lation: update the chezmoi poseidon_chezmoi_isolation_test to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the intent of 9430387a (the Mac renders a debug-info-only cargo config [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]but still ignores the poseidon files), then close bob-cli-id.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deploy guard runs the inclusion proof in both stamp arms[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]deploy-inclusion-proof[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chezmoi-isolation[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]deploy-inclusion-proof: make evaluate_guard in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]src/native/plugins/deploy.rs try find_inclusion_proof for clean stamps [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with an unknown source_head, and stop a dirty incoming checkout from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]getting a false \"no single commit holds the bundle\" refusal, then close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-or and bob-cli-pb.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian e2e runners keep bounded failure scratch[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]e2e-scratch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after deploy-inclusion-proof[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]e2e-scratch: stop the bob-plugins real-Obsidian e2e runners from leaking[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failure scratch and screenshots into the /tmp tmpfs without bound, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document where retained scratch lives, then close bob-cli-qt.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stable task-wikilink cold-build 16 ms chunk measurement[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wikilink-cold-chunk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after e2e-scratch[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wikilink-cold-chunk: make the block-id-prompt task-wikilink cold-build [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]16 ms chunk gate measure chunk cost instead of helper-thread and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cold-start noise under the serial test:perf stage, keep every budget, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]then close bob-cli-f8.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-r8","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-r8.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7eb7bcb226cca847d126f6d6f6085cf2","started_at":"2026-11-27T18:03:39.923206+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"9f62e52819cadf4a9efed23ece51de65b5a4e8cdcb789390aff6b6fe7d7dfe3c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/chat.md","size_bytes":20419},"commits":{"digest":"9acb41cc5044273b9827bc6b187a195f9e8c1febd97217e90b78199f58e3f49e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"8fb29c07e964c74c5eb4c7296aef0b9eb31a0080ef3ce30fbbf4a44b0c9dc8c2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"2475fa2e5b19c5cc0d4c7df125fc7f791f992eda09faeb98d0113b338e8813a0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"0a53ac97a5b626d49efd03ed695307c8dd578780d5823054054ace6e363d8523","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/prompt.md","size_bytes":2686},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"1dd4cc45d0464e7822dc9ee8fcabc6eef8f825f9d8b8a67faa71dd698410bcfd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":2336},"state":{"digest":"45aa68b1fc0d6f7e24e69d4ab5d057bc0346c7087304dd16ef6323d931759790","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-27T19:59:02.372137+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-r8.3--2","local_name":"bob-cli-r8.3--2","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-r8","agent_clan_generation":"20261127130